+
+    <h1>WebGL Specification</h1>
+    <h2 class="no-toc">Editor's Draft 27 April 2015</h2>
+    <dl>
+        <dt>This version:
+            <dd>
+                <a href="https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/">
