+        <dt>Latest version:
+            <dd>
+                <a href="https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/">
+                    https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/
+                </a>
+                <br>
+                <a href="https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/1.0/webgl.idl">
